{
 "slug": "orderease-alternative",
 "pageId": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
 "text_batches": [
  [
   {
    "label": "t0",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "c3df870f-ba8c-9aaf-796c-bb1249eeefa3"
     },
     "text": "20-30 Min"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t1",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fe9d"
     },
     "text": "Saved on each call that becomes an app order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t2",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "3027ca32-6180-79a6-1a66-d9f911e27a08"
     },
     "text": "24-48 Hrs"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t3",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5fea2"
     },
     "text": "Is the setup window for most distributors"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t4",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "448bf1fe-361f-3c13-6268-4572092953ba"
     },
     "text": "Same Day"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t5",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "3f7a12ca-f338-fa01-17fc-97d91ca5feac"
     },
     "text": "Is when most kitchens send their first order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t6",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "1cd5e3b3-4adf-89d2-b8a1-ba35fe69754d"
     },
     "text": "Why Teams Compare"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t7",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8be"
     },
     "text": "Why distributors shop for an alternative to OrderEase"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t8",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8c2"
     },
     "text": "Plenty of people searching for an OrderEase competitor do not want new order software at all. They have trouble with one source of orders, not six. Replacing everything to fix that one is too big a fix. Three cases come up often."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t9",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "eb7fd825-30c6-7275-9a2f-c98f68eb960f"
     },
     "text": "The platform covers every channel"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t10",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8cc"
     },
     "text": "OrderEase says itself that it covers the full path rather than one piece of it, and for a lot of sellers that is the right buy. If only one kind of order is causing trouble, the fix can be just as small."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t11",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "bacfcf90-d337-55e1-9a02-49b2f6962e16"
     },
     "text": "A PDF the software reads still needs checking"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t12",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8d3"
     },
     "text": "Software that lifts an order out of a PDF has to be checked, and OrderEase says plainly that it flags exceptions for review. That cuts the work, which is real, but someone on your side still has to go through the flagged orders."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t13",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "83921d0d-4ec1-911e-4420-fee5bfd13614"
     },
     "text": "Eight industries, and food is one of them"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t14",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "964de5d5-3961-b811-98b9-cfb069a7e8da"
     },
     "text": "Their site lists food and beverages beside lumber, apparel, pets and lawn care, which is a fair spread of wholesale. It also means the standard setup is general, not shaped around a chef placing an order at the end of service."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t15",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "f5b08e4d-7503-2dae-cdd2-6f455d9fe83d"
     },
     "text": "What an OrderEase alternative adds at the front"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t16",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "f49b7c29-2a8e-b047-d714-742b52e0a34c"
     },
     "text": "What You Get"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t17",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "d4031fde-2fc3-b283-bb1c-784e741d725b"
     },
     "text": "Voice Ordering"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t18",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0ed"
     },
     "text": "The order is built, not worked out afterwards"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t19",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "24599529-959c-8515-3ff2-44ca6d68a0f1"
     },
     "text": "A chef says what is short and the lines come up from that account's own guide, under the codes you use. They look over every line and fix anything wrong before sending, so nobody at your end rebuilds the order from a file."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t20",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4133"
     },
     "text": "The customer checks the lines, so nobody here guesses"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t21",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4139"
     },
     "text": "Said from a walk-in or an office, at any hour"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t22",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe413f"
     },
     "text": "Saves 20 to 30 minutes compared with the same order by phone"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t23",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "129bd613-9d92-1e3c-fcbe-e5fdebfe4145"
     },
     "text": "Interrupted halfway? It holds the order until they come back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t24",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "d5d6538b-4114-51aa-7fff-aad875b7bfe3"
     },
     "text": "Order Guides"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t25",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea2"
     },
     "text": "Your codes, your prices, one list per customer"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t26",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdea6"
     },
     "text": "Export the lists you keep now and we load them. Each account gets the items it actually buys at the price you set for it, so the lines on an order come from that guide, already tied to your codes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t27",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdead"
     },
     "text": "Lines arrive tied to your own codes"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t28",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb3"
     },
     "text": "You stay in charge of the catalog and the pricing"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t29",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdeb9"
     },
     "text": "Edit a guide once and the next order already has it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t30",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8c148c5a-5883-9b4b-9229-358da23fdebf"
     },
     "text": "No extra order rules to set up for these accounts"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t31",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "6555f9fc-4dcc-b940-f384-6001ce4db69f"
     },
     "text": "Delivery Formats"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t32",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb118"
     },
     "text": "Handed over however your office takes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t33",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb11c"
     },
     "text": "The finished order leaves as an email carrying a PDF, Excel or Word file, or goes straight into your ERP over the API, over EDI, or into QuickBooks. We use whichever method your desk relies on rather than asking for a new one."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t34",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb123"
     },
     "text": "Addressed to a named rep, or to the purchasing desk"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t35",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb129"
     },
     "text": "Over EDI, the API or QuickBooks, nobody on your team retypes it"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t36",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb12f"
     },
     "text": "Its own number, with the date and time it was sent"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t37",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8b079726-3463-6044-f4e9-f838b3bfb135"
     },
     "text": "Picking, billing and delivery carry on unchanged"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t38",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "099f67ce-06ef-dc92-c6e6-fdc4481f359f"
     },
     "text": "Inventory Visibility"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t39",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93a"
     },
     "text": "Stock in the picture while orders land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t40",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df93e"
     },
     "text": "VoiceOrder Solutions carries real-time inventory visibility tied to order activity, and the catalog updates as stock levels change. It does not replace your stock system: that stays in charge, and a demo shows how the levels connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t41",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df945"
     },
     "text": "Across everything you list, not only the fast movers"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t42",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df94b"
     },
     "text": "Fewer stockout surprises on a late, heavy order"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t43",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df951"
     },
     "text": "Stock numbers come from the system you count with today"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t44",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "2af8f313-e356-7eea-3f46-cef1a39df957"
     },
     "text": "We never count or buy stock for you"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t45",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "021e8cc1-41f6-a5cc-3995-2a8c101d005c"
     },
     "text": "Front And Back"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t46",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64e7"
     },
     "text": "How OrderEase and VoiceOrder Solutions divide the work"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t47",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da64ec"
     },
     "text": "We work before the order leaves the kitchen, and OrderEase works once it reaches you, so running both makes sense. We are not an OrderEase replacement: we cut down the orders that need handling, and anything still coming in as a file or over EDI is handled as it is today. Quite often that is what an OrderEase alternative turns out to mean."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t48",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da6507"
     },
     "text": "Less of the pile needs reading"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t49",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "b1f1a02d-1126-5fc3-d0e9-a08845da650a"
     },
     "text": "Accounts that move onto the app send a list they have already checked, instead of a document someone has to read. The software that reads your incoming orders gets a shorter pile, with more time for the files that keep coming."
    }
   }
  ],
  [
   {
    "label": "t50",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a6d"
     },
     "text": "Choose where spoken orders land"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t51",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "5368ca22-de87-9362-819f-9733489b5a70"
     },
     "text": "Straight into the ERP, or as an email your desk already watches. Which of those it is stays your call, not ours."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t52",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535624"
     },
     "text": "Try it on the accounts that call the most"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t53",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "ce9a8dd2-5aea-6c74-fe2d-a05cf2535627"
     },
     "text": "Adding us removes nothing, so there is no contract to end and no data to move. Start with the ones that call most and ask us what that looks like."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t54",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b4"
     },
     "text": "See one arrive already itemized"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t55",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "4590e4b1-e797-fe36-9056-58de9ded19b8"
     },
     "text": "Twenty minutes. A chef speaks an order, and you see it reach the desk itemized."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t56",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "6923bf1d-5310-eba9-bcb8-7266c5f85e97"
     },
     "text": "Getting Started"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t57",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ec7"
     },
     "text": "Three steps, and no integration phase"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t58",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "38293a1d-fb4c-9501-8014-28855f9128b6"
     },
     "text": "There is no implementation project and no IT work to schedule to make this start. You send the lists, we create the logins, the orders begin arriving."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t59",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ed6"
     },
     "text": "Send over your lists"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t60",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5eda"
     },
     "text": "A spreadsheet does it. Items and the price per account go into one admin screen, matched to the codes you already use."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t61",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ede"
     },
     "text": "Logins get created"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t62",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5ee3"
     },
     "text": "We load each guide and set up the account, then the kitchen downloads the app. Most of them send something the same day."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t63",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f00"
     },
     "text": "The order arrives ready"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t64",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "a303abc3-7d8f-f26f-40bb-74c0ec6b5f04"
     },
     "text": "The customer has approved it. It carries a number and the time it was sent, in the format your system takes."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t65",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a176"
     },
     "text": "OrderEase plus VoiceOrder Solutions."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t66",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "0c6cf9c7-bbe3-a64d-76b9-1539a90ac7c8"
     },
     "text": "All your order sources, plus voice."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t67",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "7b8acd63-aca8-b070-4eb6-f64ce47abebc"
     },
     "text": "Nothing Removed, Voice Added"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t68",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a179"
     },
     "text": "Adding voice should never cost you a way orders already reach you, so this table only adds. OrderEase is order management software: it takes orders in from many places, checks them and passes them to your ERP. You need no OrderEase alternative to keep that. What voice adds is an order your customer speaks and approves before sending. The two products do not connect."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t69",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "1ff87819-9b94-6168-dfbb-e81fd6a5b236"
     },
     "text": "Feature"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t70",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a18d"
     },
     "text": "OrderEase + VoiceOrder Solutions"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t71",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a19e"
     },
     "text": "OrderEase on its own"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t72",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1be"
     },
     "text": "Emailed PDF and CSV purchase orders parsed into orders"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t73",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1c8"
     },
     "text": "Orders spoken in, then approved line by line"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t74",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1d5"
     },
     "text": "Managed EDI with trading-partner compliance"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t75",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1e2"
     },
     "text": "Each account has its own guide, at your prices"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t76",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1ec"
     },
     "text": "Marketplace and ecommerce connections"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t77",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a1f6"
     },
     "text": "Orders checked against your rules before the ERP"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t78",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a210"
     },
     "text": "Fulfillment logic across several warehouses"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t79",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a21a"
     },
     "text": "An offline-ready app for sales reps"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t80",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "37b58628-5e21-7c67-2967-24e3b5a7a224"
     },
     "text": "Fewer emailed orders left to read"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t81",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "30f8c397-6bf9-f190-2eb1-183dc2b44d9e"
     },
     "text": "FAQ"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t82",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf956"
     },
     "text": "What distributors with many order sources ask"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t83",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "8bf0eb84-6a8d-dd56-6a0e-8116d9416d3d"
     },
     "text": "Do we need an OrderEase alternative to take spoken orders?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t84",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf967"
     },
     "text": "No. OrderEase manages what happens to orders after they reach you, from however many directions. VoiceOrder Solutions changes how one group of customers sends theirs to begin with. Keep the first and add the second; they work on separate parts of the same journey."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t85",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "ad9f0390-a776-7031-a95b-984cd1988c9e"
     },
     "text": "Is VoiceOrder Solutions better than OrderEase?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t86",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf973"
     },
     "text": "At getting a kitchen's order in already itemized and checked by the buyer, we think so. At reading an emailed purchase order, running your EDI partners or wiring up a marketplace, no: we do none of those. That job is theirs, and it can stay theirs."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t87",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "e219e293-819b-221b-6d80-7f8d2898a4d7"
     },
     "text": "We get a lot of emailed POs. Can you read those?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t88",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf97f"
     },
     "text": "No. We have no tool that reads documents, and we will not imply otherwise. We get accounts to stop sending documents, so the pile gets smaller instead of being processed. OrderEase's tools are built for the email orders that remain. One limit worth stating: only what comes through our app gets an order number, a timestamp or a stock update from us. A call or a voicemail does not."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t89",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "39590628-381c-9aea-6095-0746f7348939"
     },
     "text": "Is OrderEase tied to VoiceOrder Solutions at all?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t90",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf98b"
     },
     "text": "No. The two run apart, each with its own support, and neither has to be removed for the other to run. OrderEase keeps handling what reaches it, and our orders go into your system by their own route, in any format listed above."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t91",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "0f73d180-08e9-596f-f264-a95de40f9593"
     },
     "text": "Do accounts on the OrderEase portal have to move?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t92",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "7e541655-5a68-8f96-1273-8249a5c759bd"
     },
     "text": "No. Buyers who like the portal keep using it. Our app is for the accounts that phone or email instead, and who gets it is your choice, account by account."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t93",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "d9956fbb-a3d6-4b04-b3ab-98b6f5ae509f"
     },
     "text": "What does running both cost?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t94",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "4446ea80-4c7a-f2a8-f0de-0a222818c94f"
     },
     "text": "They are more open than we are here, and credit where it is due: their site publishes a starting figure and a setup fee, and says there is no free version and no trial. Ours is quote-based with nothing published, and since OrderEase stays, it covers only the step we add. Ask and we will quote you."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t95",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "93ba65b0-4eb0-c64e-d0c0-933cd7a92b1d"
     },
     "text": "How fast could this be running?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t96",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "cb55ed2c-634b-b694-87d5-a43e7e3cf997"
     },
     "text": "Most distributors have this working in 24 to 48 hours, and for most kitchens the first order follows the same day. Nothing in OrderEase gets connected or altered, so this asks much less of you than an OrderEase alternative that would replace it."
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t97",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-990427524516"
     },
     "text": "Where do the OrderEase details on this page come from?"
    }
   },
   {
    "label": "t98",
    "set_text": {
     "id": {
      "component": "6aca3a6bf0c2375ec4151513",
      "element": "7ec95cf1-65b0-b7be-b209-99042752451e"
     },
     "text": "We took each OrderEase detail here from orderease.com, as published on 10 October 2026: their product and channel write-ups, the industry list and the pricing page. Their published results figures belong to them and are not quoted here. If something has shifted since, that is our error rather than theirs."
    }
   }
  ]
 ],
